\label{lemma-catenary-local-rings-catenary}
Let $X$ be a scheme. The following are equivalent
\begin{enumerate}
\item $X$ is catenary, and
\item for any $x \in X$ the local ring $\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$ is
catenary.
\end{enumerate}

